            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[<h3>改进</h3>
<ul><li>重开底部栏同一标签时保留搜索和筛选</li><li>底部栏和管理窗口关闭30秒后自动回收内存</li></ul>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul><li>Reopening the same Sheet tab preserves your search and filters</li><li>Memory is reclaimed 30 seconds after closing both windows</li></ul>]]></description>
