        <item>
            <title>wdrop 1.2.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:56:08 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[<h3>改进</h3>
<ul><li>待保存的剪贴板内容可临时存盘，保存失败可重试</li><li>底部栏内容较多时，搜索结果切换更顺畅</li></ul>
<h3>修复</h3>
<ul><li>减少长时间使用的内存占用，关闭图片预览后及时释放</li><li>部分截图中的中文不再因文字识别错误而搜不到</li></ul>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul><li>Pending clipboard items can be stored temporarily on disk and retried if saving fails</li><li>Smoother search result changes in the Sheet with many items</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>Reduced memory use during extended use and released images when closing previews</li><li>Chinese text in some screenshots is now searchable despite recognition errors</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/yepyeel/wdrop-updates/releases/download/v1.2.2-build.9/wdrop-1.2.2.dmg" length="11295495" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="AnpzAIem0kSlJZM1Rxgp2E81qUDAOXXED8IXpOSwYQY7pBUth6lsJzGAavPdieiDIse3Ba2+oLJnwe6yVBE1AA=="/>
        </item>
